After we got our Infoserver & RRD42 (about a year ago) I wondered the
same thing, since it has a volume control and audio jack.  I tried
several free- and shareware apps, none of them recognized the drive.
I posted the question on Compuserve, and asked a field service rep,
the responses were "no".  The only reason the drive had a volume
