>>Hi there,
>>I want to set up an HP "Envizex" Xterminal to have our VAXstation 4000-90
>>(VMS 6.0, X11R5) as a client, so I can click on the name of the VAX and
>>have the Decwindows login screen come up.
<SNIP>
