references: <40qmoi$l1q@explorer.csc.com> <40thqr$i1d@nntpd.lkg.dec.com> <40u0ad$iql@topaz.sensor.com> <41077c$99p@nntpd.lkg.dec.com>
organization: Sensor Systems
