Overview
========
This is part 1 of the Frequently Asked Questions posting for comp.unix.ultrix,
with answers about the ULTRIX operating system.  It is also posted on
comp.sys.dec, but it is not a full FAQ for comp.sys.dec.  Part 2 has answers
that apply to both ULTRIX and Digital UNIX (DEC OSF/1 AXP)  and part 3 has
answers that apply  to Digital UNIX alone.

This FAQ is archived in the following locations:
