>
>	I am trying to boot this DEC Station 5000/125 I just got my hands
>on.  Unfortunately I have no idea how to boot the machine.  I have tried
>the following command (but without any luck): boot rz(0,3,0)/vmunix

Assuming you're booting from rz0.  If not, replace "rz0" with whatever disk
you're booting from.

	>> boot 3/rz0/vmunix 
		or
	>> boot 3/rz0/vmunix -a 	for multiuser mode

To make it permanent:

	>> setenv boot 3/rz0/vmunix
		or
	>> setenv boot "3/rz0/vmunix -a"

