An even better reference is the _Message Utility Manual, which discusses
messages in detail.  There *IS* one message: it's specified by bits 3-15 of the
message code.  Severity is specified by bits 0-2.  Facility by bits 16-27, and
internal control flags (including whether DCL should automatically display the
message when your image exits) by bits 28-31.  Now, RTFM, and don't bitch again
unless you're willing to learn something instead of mindlessly repeating your
witless diatribe.
