Hi!


It's kind of arcane, but there are two mailx options ~a and ~A that will
auto-sign your mail message with a string specified in your mail config
file. The ~a inserts the string specified in the "sign=" string and ~A
inserts the string from "Sign=". The ~i <variable> command is a generalized
way of doing this.

Read the man page for mailx for exact details. 



