     When you say "OEM motherboards" I assume that you are referring
     to the AXPpci33.

     The flash on the AXPpci33 is not large enough to hold firmware
     for both NT and Digital UNIX.  It is possible to reflash the
     firmware from floppy.  The instructions for this (and the latest
     firmware) can be found at:

  ftp://ftp.digital.com/pub/Digital/axppci                     (U.S.)
  ftp://ftp.digital.de/pub/Digital/oem/boards/AXPpci33/support (Europe)

     Given the right licenses, you can boot either operating system.

