I would suggest the following:  Get a LCD *monitor* (available from a 
few industrial computing supply places) attached to a low-end PC, and 
run a good quality MS-DOS based VT emulator (MS-Kermit would be my first 
choice).  If you used an old '286 or even 8088 based PC, the cost would be 
purely in the LCD monitor.  If disk drives are troubled by the magnetism, 
the terminals could be made diskless with boot ROMs on a LAN adapter.


