Vic,
We have about 7 of them. They connect to an ethernet (usually via a DELNI 
network interface). When you power them up, they request a software 
download which must be preconfigured on the VAX.  There is specific 
software for them that must be running on the VAX.  Assuming that there 
s/w loads correctly, you can run 8 serial terminals (eg. VT220/320/420). 
Each terminal can have upto 4 sessions each.  

I don't know if I gave you more or less than you wanted, but let me know 
if you need more.

Ken




