>I'm trying to porting some code to Alpha/DEC 'C' from VAX/VAX 'C'. We have, 
>however, hit a problem with the <errno.h> include file. It #defines it to be 
>(*cma$tis_errno_get_addr()). The trouble is, we have number of structures that 
